mat="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKAUE, TAKUMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, TEPPEI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIHARA NOBUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKAUE TAKUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA TEPPEI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIHARA, NOBUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKAUE, TAKUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, TEPPEI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The invention relates to a recording device, a recording method, a reproducing device and a reproducing method. A compressed digital signal is divided into blocks, and fixed-value data is inserted for every predetermined number of blocks to form an encrypted signal. On reception, the expansion of the encrypted signal is permitted depending on whether the inserted fixed-value data have been successfully decoded.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif d'enregistrement, un procédé d'enregistrement, un dispositif de reproduction et un procédé de reproduction. Un signal numérique compressé est divisé en blocs, et des données à valeur fixe sont insérées pour chaque nombre prédéterminé de blocs pour former un signal chiffré. Lors de la réception, la décompression du signal chiffré est autorisée selon que les données à valeur fixe insérées ont été décodées avec succès.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>